  "_games_comment": "Triggers with a `game` key resolve through per-room game logic (mirrored in sim/web/app.js and the room node firmware, wiring-guides/room-games-plan.md): gate = two banks of 3 simultaneous body-pressed arcade buttons (bank 1 -> CorrectAnswer chime, then bank 2 -> CorrectAnswer chime, then leave on the room occupancy trigger); porto = 1 random winning knock pad of 3 per room entry, attempt 1 always fails, attempts 2-3 pass on the winner, attempt 4 force-passes; dph = 1 random winner of 5 per room entry (CorrectAnswer on winner; others WrongAnswer); bike = 2 static true/false answers for this room (both right -> chime then BikeLockRoom); moop = 4 standalone battery button pucks (each press -> CorrectAnswer, all four unique pucks in 60s -> VerticalMoopMarch-RightAnswer, timeout after partial set -> VerticalMoopMarch-WrongAnswer); lightsout = 5 lit truck buttons, press toggles self+neighbors, all lit -> chime then NoFriendsMonday."
}
